# 🛒 Sistem Kasir Backend API

REST API untuk aplikasi **Point of Sale (POS)** yang dibangun menggunakan **Express.js**, **Prisma ORM**, **PostgreSQL (NeonDB)**, **JWT Authentication**, dan **Zod Validation**.

Proyek ini dirancang untuk mengelola autentikasi pengguna, manajemen produk, kategori, serta transaksi penjualan dengan pengurangan stok otomatis dan sistem otorisasi berbasis role.

---

## 🚀 Tech Stack

* Node.js
* Express.js
* Prisma ORM
* PostgreSQL (NeonDB)
* JWT Authentication
* Zod Validation
* Bcrypt

---

## ✨ Features

### 🔐 Authentication

* Register User
* Login User
* JWT Authentication
* Get Current User (`/me`)
* Role Based Access Control (Admin & Kasir)

### 📂 Category Management

* Create Category
* Get All Categories
* Get Category By ID
* Update Category
* Delete Category

### 📦 Product Management

* Create Product
* Get All Products
* Get Product By ID
* Update Product
* Soft Delete Product
* Search Product
* Pagination

### 💳 Transaction Management

* Create Transaction (Checkout)
* Automatic Stock Reduction
* Transaction History
* Transaction Detail
* Filter Transaction by User
* Filter Transaction by Date

---

## 📁 Project Structure

```text
src
├── controllers
├── middlewares
├── routes
├── services
├── validations
├── lib
└── app.js
```

### Folder Description

| Folder      | Description                            |
| ----------- | -------------------------------------- |
| controllers | Handle request & response              |
| services    | Business logic                         |
| routes      | API route definitions                  |
| middlewares | Authentication & authorization         |
| validations | Request validation using Zod           |
| lib         | Shared utilities (Prisma Client, etc.) |

---

## ⚙️ Installation

### Clone Repository

```bash
git clone https://github.com/your-username/backend-sistem-kasir.git

cd backend-sistem-kasir
```

### Install Dependencies

```bash
npm install
```

---

## 🔑 Environment Variables

Create a `.env` file:

```env
DATABASE_URL=your_database_url
JWT_SECRET=your_secret_key
PORT=3000
```

---

## 🗄️ Database Setup

Generate Prisma Client:

```bash
npx prisma generate
```

Push schema to database:

```bash
npx prisma db push
```

---

## ▶️ Running Application

Development Mode:

```bash
npm run dev
```

Production Mode:

```bash
npm start
```

Server will run on:

```text
http://localhost:3000
```

---

# 🔐 Authentication

## Register

**POST**

```http
/api/auth/register
```

Request Body:

```json
{
  "username": "adi",
  "email": "adi@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}
```

---

## Login

**POST**

```http
/api/auth/login
```

Request Body:

```json
{
  "email": "adi@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}
```

Response:

```json
{
  "token": "jwt_token"
}
```

Use token for protected endpoints:

```http
Authorization: Bearer <token>
```

---

# 📦 Product Endpoints

## Get Products

```http
GET /api/products
```

## Search Product

```http
GET /api/products?search=indomie
```

## Pagination

```http
GET /api/products?page=1&limit=10
```

## Search + Pagination

```http
GET /api/products?search=indomie&page=1&limit=10
```

---

# 💳 Transaction Endpoints

## Create Transaction

```http
POST /api/transactions
```

Request Body:

```json
{
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": "PRODUCT_ID",
      "quantity": 2
    }
  ]
}
```

---

## Get All Transactions

```http
GET /api/transactions
```

---

## Filter By User

```http
GET /api/transactions?userId=USER_ID
```

---

## Filter By Date

```http
GET /api/transactions?date=2026-06-01
```

---

## Get Transaction Detail

```http
GET /api/transactions/:id
```

---

# 📋 Business Rules

## Soft Delete Product

Products are not permanently removed from the database.

Field used:

```text
deletedAt
```

Deleted products:

* Will not appear in product listings
* Cannot be used in transactions
* Existing transaction history remains intact

---

## Stock Management

When a transaction succeeds:

```text
Stock = Stock - Quantity
```

If stock is insufficient:

```text
Transaction Failed
```

---

## Atomic Checkout Process

Checkout uses Prisma Transaction:

```javascript
prisma.$transaction()
```

Operations executed atomically:

* Create Transaction
* Create Transaction Items
* Update Product Stock

If one operation fails, all changes are rolled back.

